{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0064_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "1048429c3f4fa21e00f2cccf920564f16f2b369e1a8a11ebc397d49a285ba102", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}も見て見てっ♪\nどう？　とってもいいでショ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你也看看嘛♪\n怎么样？超棒的对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "70bf5a6a2f7fee2cb6112482fcf2a180ac9090634513d34d17ad26dbe5d5fc75", "ja": "ああ、エレナにすごく似合ってるぞ。\nその衣装なら、ダンスにもとっても映えるだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，非常适合艾琳娜喔。\n穿着这套服装，跳起舞来应该也会很亮眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
